{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"868869546004582460","content":"Finn shares his vows, he does his best to hide his hastily written note in his sleeve. But is grateful it is still there.\n\n\"Vivvy, I promise to be with you through sickness and in health, through the nuclear developments I accidentally create with Bowen, the highly unethical bullets I tend to create, losing my mind literally when I'm up in the air with you, through lethal serial killer hunts, and all the other dangerous stuff I put you through. \n\nI vow to love you now, always, forever, and even after I probably should have died, but hey, we're working on that bit. Death do us part and all that, I promise to live a life with you that isn't outlasted by age, but burns with love and commitment.\n\nI also promise that I will let you have as many ducks as you'd like in our house, hey we could even make a sanctuary on one of my islands in the Caribbean.\n\nI promise to share my retainers for morning and mid afternoon foot massages, and on occasion in the evenings. I promise to show you the world and take it one day at a time together.\n\nVivvy, I promise to ***do the thing*** with you now and forever.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:44:15.163000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879586884349730836","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
